Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.72,0:01:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We figured the eighth child had to be\Nsomewhere in the Shibuya section of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.94,0:01:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so the rest of us spread\Nout while Joe made phone
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.62,0:01:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,calls to every school kid\Nwe knew four years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.28,0:01:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe one of those kids\Nis the Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.84,0:01:47.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.75,0:01:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that flea-bitten menace, Gatomon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.60,0:01:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was still on the prowl, causing\Nwho knows what kind of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.74,0:01:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanie and Sora stumbled onto this\Nfire-breathing bozo called Skull Meramon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:02:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and things looked pretty\Ngnarly till MetalGreymon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.18,0:02:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,joined the fight and was\Nable to cool him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.62,0:02:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the ghost is Shibuya-Degimon!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.52,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Pump and Gotsu are Shibuya-type Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.37,0:02:30.96,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\fad(3000,0)}Year 1999
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.37,0:02:30.96,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\fad(3000,0)}August 2nd
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.37,0:02:30.96,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\fad(3000,0)}Shibuya
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.68,0:02:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, check them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.24,0:02:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ew!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.24,0:02:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So these are city people\Nin the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.74,0:02:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't look like much fun.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.01,0:02:52.52,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Pumpmon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.01,0:02:52.52,Sign,,370,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.01,0:02:52.52,Sign,,370,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Vaccine
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.01,0:02:52.52,Sign,,370,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Puppet Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.01,0:02:52.52,Sign,,370,0,305,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.01,0:02:52.52,Sign,,370,0,335,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Trick or Treat
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.18,0:02:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real Pumpkinmon, you're the right\Nguy to teach them what fun really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.88,0:02:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are, without a doubt,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.10,0:02:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the most rocking creature to\Never have a pumpkin for a head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.30,0:02:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, Cheeks dig evil Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.74,0:02:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least that's what I keep\Ntelling myself, anyway.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.44,0:03:05.45,Sign,,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Gotsumon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.44,0:03:05.45,Sign,,370,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Child
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.44,0:03:05.45,Sign,,370,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Data
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.44,0:03:05.45,Sign,,370,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Ore Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.44,0:03:05.45,Sign,,370,0,305,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.44,0:03:05.45,Sign,,370,0,345,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Angry Rock
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.90,0:02:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotsumon, you are the mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.92,0:03:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to have such a\Nblast here in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.28,0:03:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They might even name a building after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.10,0:03:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Gatsuman-yament, where they\Nkeep all the party supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.64,0:03:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.76,0:03:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.58,0:03:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,longer, Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.80,0:03:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax, CK.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.74,0:03:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're almost home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.90,0:03:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt and T .K.'s mom and\Ndad aren't together anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.80,0:03:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon. So even though they're brothers,\Nthey don't live together. So T.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.46,0:03:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lives with their mom and Matt\Nlives with their dad That
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,explains why they try so hard\Nto stay together all the time
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.50,0:03:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure late Yeah, so?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.30,0:03:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next stop's good enough
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.98,0:03:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm gonna take you all\Nthe way home, little brother
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.36,0:03:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.44,0:03:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I don't have to,\Nbut I'm going to, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.60,0:03:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got my reasons. What reasons?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:03:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.84,0:04:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.06,0:04:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, nothing like sweet brotherly love.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.58,0:04:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a dirty mouthful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.20,0:04:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We like when you guys get mushy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.62,0:04:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, quit it. Easy, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.92,0:04:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be mean about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.06,0:04:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought what you guys said\Nwas not your own beeswax.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.04,0:04:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why listen to our\Nconversation anyway? Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.14,0:04:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want me around. I'll leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.04,0:04:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.76,0:04:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what I'm not wanting!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.48,0:04:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon, don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.42,0:04:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon got off the train, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.58,0:04:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to go after him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.92,0:04:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.74,0:04:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you care about him. Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.48,0:04:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.39,0:04:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better decide, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.34,0:04:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The door's closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.18,0:04:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.32,0:04:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.10,0:05:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems like we've been\Nwalking around for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.56,0:05:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm tired, and I don't\Neven have any feet or legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.16,0:05:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have yelled\Nat him like that, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.78,0:05:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.60,0:05:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.04,0:05:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.24,0:05:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry I understand, TK I know\Nyou didn't mean to hurt his feelings Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.92,0:05:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought he was making fun of us No way,\Ndude You know Patamon better than that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.94,0:05:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't we try looking over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.28,0:05:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, another winner
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.74,0:05:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So will you give me a\Nfew? What again? I'll pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.92,0:05:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you back i promise you'll\Npay me back with what
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.86,0:05:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with what i'm about to\Nwin but you never win i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.58,0:05:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hot tonight hey you two\Nyou kids just don't get
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.06,0:06:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the message get out and if you have to try
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.34,0:06:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sneaking in here dressed\Nas cartoon characters at
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.00,0:06:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,least get a decent costume\Nboy it's a good thing
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.52,0:06:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were just about to leave.\NWe teach us a mammoth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.78,0:06:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you just say? Uh-oh. No, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.38,0:06:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I told her, don't get the\Nfuchsia lip gloss whatever you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.42,0:06:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.62,0:06:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.53,0:06:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you knocked over a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.06,0:06:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even worse, I think I\Nknocked over a teenager.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.08,0:06:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard about these strange-looking
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.62,0:06:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.53,0:06:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it takes one to know one. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.88,0:06:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know what time it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.14,0:06:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for new clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.32,0:06:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get lost, you creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.28,0:06:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's with the costumes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.80,0:06:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you guys a little\Nlate for Halloween?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.68,0:06:42.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's Halloween?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.59,0:06:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I like these\Nteenage things me either maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.50,0:06:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can reprogram her if I\Npull out her safety mechanism
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.38,0:07:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you two in such a hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.70,0:07:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know these guys? I sure do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.88,0:07:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They work for Myotismon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.98,0:07:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.89,0:07:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But right now we're being chased by\Nsomething even scarier than Myotismon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.50,0:07:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a really mad\Nteenage human after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.86,0:07:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,\Nyou'd better hide too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.54,0:07:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.72,0:07:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can run, but you can't hide\Ndressed in those stupid costumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.82,0:07:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.73,0:07:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They went that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.10,0:07:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.28,0:07:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I know why you two\Ntroublemakers are in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.68,0:07:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did Myotismon happen to send\Nyou here to find someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.98,0:07:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that 8th Digidestined kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.46,0:07:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you're our enemy. No, we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.92,0:08:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just want to cruise around\Nthe city and have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.16,0:08:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we thought you\Ntwo were evil Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.86,0:08:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Evil Shmeevil!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.86,0:08:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We love it here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.84,0:08:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, next stop, Hollywood!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.38,0:08:10.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not ready for TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.94,0:08:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Typical, everybody wants to be in show\Nbusiness Lights, cameras, and action
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.46,0:08:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's some lights\NWhat are they doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.68,0:08:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, get down
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.38,0:08:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough. That's not funny, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.50,0:08:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sirens Get down or the\Npolice will arrest you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.84,0:08:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better get out of here, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.42,0:08:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.96,0:08:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he just say let's run? Sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.70,0:08:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.46,0:08:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are Pumpkinmon and Gotsumon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.88,0:09:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were right behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.14,0:09:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must have gotten lost or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.00,0:09:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two, even when\Nthey're found, they're lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.78,0:09:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady, ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.86,0:09:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.90,0:09:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think this one makes me look\Nfat, but what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.22,0:09:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then, let's switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.56,0:09:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys need to change your attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.74,0:09:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to change your clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.46,0:09:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This look says you're\Nnot afraid to think big.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.42,0:09:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's a sporty look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.80,0:09:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, I haven't figured\Nout what sport it is yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.56,0:09:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And finally, something\Nnice in a little teddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.30,0:09:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.04,0:09:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Patamon! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.82,0:09:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.96,0:09:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So should we follow those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.60,0:09:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.22,0:09:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see him anywhere, Matt? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.90,0:09:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we lost him again, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.30,0:09:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon doesn't usually hold a grudge, but\Nhe was mad as a bull with a black gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.96,0:09:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey now, don't look so bummed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.06,0:09:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm sure you'll find your\Nlittle flying pig friend somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.88,0:10:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe some ice cream will\Ncheer you all up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.82,0:10:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.88,0:10:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys don't have any money,\Nso how did you get ice cream?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We stole it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.86,0:10:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You brux, come back\Nhere with my ice cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.36,0:10:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.44,0:10:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everywhere you guys go, there's trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.74,0:10:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next time you two get someone angry,\Nmake sure they can't run very fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.06,0:10:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, want some ice cream?\NNot me. You stole it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.70,0:10:32.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon won't take it either, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.66,0:10:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.58,0:10:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.92,0:10:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Myotismon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.12,0:10:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Myotismon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.90,0:11:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Redeem yourselves by stealing the\Ncrests from these children or else
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.28,0:11:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.72,0:11:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just what we were about to do
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.98,0:11:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.58,0:11:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you believe those\Ntwo are cheering on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.38,0:12:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I thought Pumpkinmon and Gotsumon\Nonly wanted to have fun, not fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.96,0:12:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose they'd rather fight\Nus than fight Myotismon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.60,0:12:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I just can't stay mad at TK anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.46,0:12:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I really miss him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.08,0:12:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I told Rebecca and Sarah to\Njust find us at the park later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.24,0:12:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.15,0:12:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like, it's so easy to\Nfind somebody at the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.20,0:12:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's totally easy\Nto find somebody there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.78,0:12:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, in the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.18,0:12:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, how'd you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.88,0:12:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't I amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.34,0:12:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you might make a nice pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.30,0:12:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.44,0:12:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so. We're surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.20,0:12:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry we have to do this to you\Nguys, but orders are orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.02,0:12:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, if it's a fight\Nyou want, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.68,0:13:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.38,0:13:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.96,0:13:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.87,0:13:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should we fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.86,0:13:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody always gets hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.00,0:13:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, it's way more fun just hanging\Nout and cruising around the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.62,0:13:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.80,0:13:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't you guys hang out with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.08,0:13:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.82,0:13:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, my Otismon's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.78,0:13:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should all hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.52,0:13:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.58,0:13:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are the Digidestined?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.86,0:13:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, they were here just a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.88,0:13:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must have got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.86,0:13:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.77,0:13:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't believe how fast they\Nare, but we almost had them, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.06,0:13:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.76,0:13:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.64,0:13:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm condemning you to my\Ndungeon in the Digi-World.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.24,0:13:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grizzly Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.36,0:13:55.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pumpkinmon power!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.00,0:14:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rock fist attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.78,0:14:11.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pokémon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.88,0:14:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pokémon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.79,0:14:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotsumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.71,0:14:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.58,0:14:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that wasn't very difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.96,0:14:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.82,0:14:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two, they were\Nreally trying to save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.90,0:14:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.08,0:14:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and you just condemned them\Nfor no reason at all! Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.44,0:14:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.14,0:14:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, Digivolve, jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.78,0:15:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go get him
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.74,0:15:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He should pay for what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.00,0:15:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to those two Crimson Lightning
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.84,0:15:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys just wanted to be our friends
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.24,0:15:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.26,0:15:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.64,0:15:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon Digivolve to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.80,0:15:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.20,0:15:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon Garurumon
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.14,0:16:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.56,0:16:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go and get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.32,0:16:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.32,0:16:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those girls said the park was the\Nplace to find someone, but where's TK?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.64,0:16:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.84,0:16:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.18,0:16:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.74,0:16:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.56,0:16:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crimson Lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.56,0:17:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,WereGarurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.72,0:17:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're Garurumons in big\Ntrouble, and it's all my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.16,0:17:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't been so mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.90,0:17:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon would still be with us, and we\Nwould have never met Punkymon and Gotsumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.66,0:17:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if those poor guys\Nhad never met up with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.66,0:17:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They wouldn't be stuck\Nwhere they are now. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.26,0:17:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.42,0:17:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.40,0:17:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon! Go, monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.62,0:17:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.52,0:17:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.54,0:17:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.76,0:17:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.54,0:17:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.32,0:17:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Digivolving!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.56,0:17:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon! Digivolve! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.72,0:17:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.63,0:17:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.84,0:17:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.66,0:18:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.60,0:18:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.84,0:18:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon Are you all\Nright, we're Garurumon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.26,0:18:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, thanks to you I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.18,0:18:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.36,0:18:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess we don't have\Nto look for Patamon anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.68,0:18:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, Angemon, they must be\Ndesperate if they sent you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.96,0:18:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon, shall we take him? Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.80,0:18:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Digimon, hey, Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.08,0:18:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice and friends to the boys and girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.66,0:18:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Digimon, hey, Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.52,0:18:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drop me up so this isn't over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.94,0:18:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time I take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.86,0:18:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will fight again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.22,0:19:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Digimon. Hey, Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.50,0:19:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Champions of...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.24,0:19:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope they're all right. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.98,0:19:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.60,0:19:11.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.08,0:19:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.32,0:19:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.92,0:19:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm all right now. K .K.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.52,0:19:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Patamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.12,0:19:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I got mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.84,0:19:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, T.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.36,0:19:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.14,0:19:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look in that window.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.12,0:19:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where those crazy Digimon\Ntried on all the clothes, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.14,0:19:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.18,0:19:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going Hollywood!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.80,0:19:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.52,0:19:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, have some ice cream, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.54,0:19:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was a steal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.54,0:20:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.22,0:20:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what you mean, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.96,0:20:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I miss them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.68,0:20:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we shouldn't take\Nour friends for granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.30,0:20:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.21,0:20:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nearly lost Patamon's friendship,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.18,0:20:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and who knows if we'll ever see\NPumpkinmon and Gotsumon again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.00,0:20:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But one thing's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.46,0:20:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know Myotismon isn't\Nthrough with us yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.02,0:20:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His henchmen are out there right now,\Nsearching for the eighth Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.44,0:20:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may be sweet, little Kari, but\Nnext time I will get my claws into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.80,0:20:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will Kari survive her next\Nencounter with Gatomon Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.26,0:20:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iorosmon's most loyal servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.32,0:20:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find out on the next\NDigimon Digital Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.06,0:21:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid of my face, but\NI'm not afraid of my future.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.06,0:21:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a smile,\NI'll give you a smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.96,0:21:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of the\Nheart, a weekly self.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.32,0:21:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you another\None. I'll be strong again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.42,0:22:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.98,0:22:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La, la,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.62,0:22:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,la, la, la, la,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.50,0:22:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,la
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.88,0:22:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.79,0:22:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and lost his memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.32,0:22:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, when the Withermon was sent,\Nthe Tailmon was in front of the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.34,0:22:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The memories were revealed,\Nand the truth was revealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.16,0:22:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time on Digimon Adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.46,0:23:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, the adventure is going to be.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.06,0:23:04.94,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}The Bonds of Fate! Tailmon

